- **Structure:** the provided date code node runs first and leads to these steps: opening (callback, transfer, close) → identity (verify, transfer, close) → account lookup → router → negotiate. Each of the six exit situations (refused, hardship, already_paid, dispute, restructuring, human) has its own short node. Every node that can close the call goes to a single hang-up node once the close succeeds.
